bution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__panel"><h4 class="type-micro">MY KEY CONTRIBUTIONS</h4><ul class="type-small"><li>Design probes</li><li>Client meetings with YWCA Hamilton</li><li>Reviewing transcripts from other groups</li><li>Research synthesis</li><li>Initial service blueprint</li></ul></div></article><article class="contribution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__phase contribution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__purple"><p class="contribution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__weeks type-micro">W06–09</p><h3 class="type-subtitle">Solution Iteration &amp; Systems Design</h3><p class="contribution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__phaseDescription type-body">Explore several solution directions, validate ideas with the client, and examine the stakeholder ecosystem, funding, and long-term service support.</p><div class="contribution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__panel"><h4 class="type-micro">MY KEY CONTRIBUTIONS</h4><ul class="type-small"><li>Solution iterations</li><li>Stakeholder mapping</li><li>Service maps and diagrams</li><li>System and implementation visualization</li></ul></div></article><article class="contribution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__phase contribution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__teal"><p class="contribution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__weeks type-micro">W09–12</p><h3 class="type-subtitle">Implementation &amp; Final Delivery</h3><p class="contribution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__phaseDescription type-body">Finalize the Knowledge Hub direction, develop the final service deliverables, and prepare for the project presentation.</p><div class="contribution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__panel"><h4 class="type-micro">MY KEY CONTRIBUTIONS</h4><ul class="type-small"><li>Final service blueprint and maps</li><li>Implementation plan</li><li>Presentation visuals</li><li>Partial involvement in presentation preparation</li><li>Participation in the final presentation</li></ul></div></article></div></div><div class="contribution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__reflection"><h3 class="type-h2">My Reflection</h3><p class="contribution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__reflectionIntroduction type-body">This project deepened my understanding of community-based service design and strengthened my ability to turn complex research into clear, actionable solutions.</p><div class="contribution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__reflections"><article class="contribution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__orange"><div class="contribution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 16a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8M23 16a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8M2 27v-3c0-6 14-6 14 0v3M18 27v-3c0-6 12-6 12 0v3"></path></svg></div><h4 class="type-subtitle">Working with Diverse Stakeholders</h4><p class="type-body">I learned how to navigate different perspectives across OACAO, Link Workers, and multiple Senior Centres, and find common ground among diverse needs and constraints.</p></article><article class="contribution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__rose"><div class="contribution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 5h9v8H3ZM20 19h9v8h-9ZM7 19h8v8H7ZM12 9h12v10M7 13v6"></path></svg></div><h4 class="type-subtitle">From Research to Visual Systems</h4><p class="type-body">I developed my ability to synthesize complex information and translate it into clear service maps, diagrams, and implementation plans that support decision-making.</p></article><article class="contribution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__teal"><div class="contribution-reflection-module__mhwxbW__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M16 29V15M16 20C6 20 3 13 4 5c9 0 12 6 12 15M16 15c0-8 5-12 13-11 0 8-5 12-13 11"></path></svg></div><h4 class="type-subtitle">Designing for Long-Term Impact</h4><p class="type-body">This project made me more aware of the importance of sustainability in service design, including funding, ownership, and ongoing community support beyond the initial delivery.</p></article></div></div></section><div class="closing-module__c0l4sG__closing closing-module__c0l4sG__wellbeing"><div class="closing-module__c0l4sG__quote"><p class="closing-module__c0l4sG__eyebrow">A THOUGHT ON HUMAN CONNECTION</p><p class="closing-module__c0l4sG__statement">“No man is an island, entire of itself.”</p><span class="closing-module__c0l4sG__accent" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="closing-module__c0l4sG__attribution">John Donne / Meditation XVII</p></div></div><footer class="case-study-footer-module__ZmNf5a__footer case-study-footer-module__ZmNf5a__light"><nav class="case-study-footer-module__ZmNf5a__navigation type-micro" aria-label="Continue exploring"><a class="case-study-footer-module__ZmNf5a__back" href="/cheryl-portfolio/ux-service/"><span class="case-study-footer-module__ZmNf5a__glow" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="case-study-footer-module__ZmNf5a__label"><span class="case-study-footer-module__ZmNf5a__arrow case-study-footer-module__ZmNf5a__leftArrow" aria-hidden="true">←</span> <!-- -->BACK TO UX / SERVICE</span></a><a class="case-study-footer-module__ZmNf5a__home" href="/cheryl-portfolio/"><span class="case-study-footer-module__ZmNf5a__glow" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="case-study-footer-module__ZmNf5a__label">HOME</span></a><a class="case-study-footer-module__ZmNf5a__project" href="/cheryl-portfolio/ux-service/bmw-scadpro/"><span class="case-study-footer-module__ZmNf5a__glow" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="case-study-footer-module__ZmNf5a__label">NEXT PROJECT<!-- --> <span class="case-study-footer-module__ZmNf5a__arrow case-study-footer-module__ZmNf5a__rightArrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a></nav></footer></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src="/cheryl-portfolio/_next/static/chunks/3s6nzrbk-8mnv.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[39756,[\"/cheryl-portfolio/_next/s